summary.label:
The Lakota Local Schools ParentSquare app provides a simple and customizable way to access and keep all your Lakota district- and school-level communications organized. It is a safe and secure way for parents and educators to connect with one another. With this app you’ll be able to:

- Stay up-to-date on the latest Lakota district announcements;

- Access current and past announcements from your school(s);

- Manage the frequency of email communications; 

- View upcoming events;

- Manage app notifications;

- View attendance notices; and

- View bus notices.
